  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Electricity Sector Modernization and Sustainability Project (KEMS) in Kyrgyz Republic SingleDonor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The objectives of the Trust Fund are to support activities       associated with the Bank financed Kyrgyz Republic Electricity Sector Modernization and Sustainability Project (P177871) (the &quot;&quot;Project&quot;&quot;). The specific objective of the Project is to improve the financial performance and operational reliability of the electricity sector.&quot;</narrative>
